---
// src/pages/saxophonist.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
	title="Saxophonist | Javier Flores — Musician & International Tours"
	description="Javier Flores, saxophonist and scholarship musician: soloist, arranger, and founding member of the Atlixco Chamber Orchestra, with international tours in Taiwan and the UAE."
	lang="en"
	pathEs="saxofonista"
	pathEn="saxophonist"
>
	<div class="sax-container">
		<!-- Hero Section Homologado -->
		<section class="sax-hero">
			<div class="hero-inner">
				<span class="hero-badge">Professional Saxophonist & Touring Musician</span>
				<h1 class="hero-title">Saxophonist & Performer</h1>
				<p class="hero-subtitle">Bringing expressive tone, technical precision, and dynamic artistry to solo performances, chamber ensembles, and international stages since age 8.</p>
				<div class="divider-line"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Main Content Sections -->
		<div id="main" class="main-content-wrapper">
			<!-- Section 1: ITESM Puebla -->
			<section class="sax-section">
				<div class="inner">
					<div class="sax-grid">
						<div class="sax-media-wrapper">
							<div class="media-card">
								<div class="video-container">
									<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/334967451" width="100%" height="340" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
								</div>
								<div class="media-caption">Representative Musician Solo Performance — ITESM Puebla</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="sax-text-content">
							<span class="section-tag">01 / University Cultural Talent</span>
							<h2>Representative Musician — ITESM Puebla</h2>
							<p>As a scholarship student for cultural talent at Tecnológico de Monterrey, I perform on alto, tenor, and soprano saxophones. My scholarship service involves representing the university as a featured soloist and ensemble musician, performing alongside the university chamber orchestra and marching band.</p>
							<p>I have participated in large-scale musicals, concerts, and university productions, frequently taking the stage as a featured soloist in major venues hosting over 4,000 attendees.</p>
							<div class="tech-specs">
								<span class="spec-badge">Scholarship Musician</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">ITESM Puebla</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Alto / Tenor / Soprano</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Soloist & Ensembles</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 2: International Tours -->
			<section class="sax-section alt-bg">
				<div class="inner">
					<div class="sax-grid reverse">
						<div class="sax-text-content">
							<span class="section-tag">02 / Global Stage</span>
							<h2>International Tours</h2>
							<p>As part of the musician lineup for the <strong>Hidalgo Magisterial Folkloric Company</strong>, I have had the extraordinary privilege of contributing to two major international tours.</p>
							<p>The first tour brought our music to Taiwan for the prestigious <strong>"Yilan International Children’s Folklore and Folkgame Festival"</strong> in 2018—one of the largest global folklore celebrations worldwide.</p>
							<p>My second international tour took place in the United Arab Emirates for <strong>"Sharjah Heritage Days"</strong>, where we performed across Sharjah and Dubai, and recorded in a professional recording studio at the University City of Sharjah.</p>
							<div class="tech-specs">
								<span class="spec-badge">International Tours</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Taiwan Yilan Festival 2018</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">UAE Sharjah Days</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Folkloric Company</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="sax-media-wrapper">
							<div class="media-card">
								<div class="video-container">
									<iframe src="https://www.facebook.com/plugins/video.php?href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Falejandro.c.gonzalez.12%2Fvideos%2F10155880273594613%2F&width=600&show_text=false&height=340&appId" width="100%" height="340" style="border:none;overflow:hidden" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowTransparency="true" allow="encrypted-media" allowFullScreen="true"></iframe>
								</div>
								<div class="media-caption">International Tour Performance — Taiwan & United Arab Emirates</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 3: Cóctel Calavera -->
			<section class="sax-section">
				<div class="inner">
					<div class="sax-grid">
						<div class="sax-media-wrapper">
							<div class="media-card">
								<div class="video-container soundcloud-container">
									<iframe width="100%" height="340" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/135787483&color=%2300e5ff&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true&visual=true"></iframe>
								</div>
								<div class="media-caption">Cóctel Calavera — Studio Track Stream on SoundCloud</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="sax-text-content">
							<span class="section-tag">03 / Independent Bands</span>
							<h2>Cóctel Calavera</h2>
							<p>Throughout my musical journey, performing with independent bands has provided incredible artistic growth. With <strong>Cóctel Calavera</strong>, I performed at numerous festivals, live venues, and musical contests, while also participating in studio recording sessions.</p>
							<p>Listen to representative studio tracks from Cóctel Calavera on SoundCloud.</p>
							<div class="tech-specs">
								<span class="spec-badge">Band Performance</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Studio Recordings</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">SoundCloud</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Live Festivals</span>
							</div>
							<div class="actions-wrapper">
								<a href="https://www.facebook.com/CoctelCalavera/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button primary-btn icon fa-facebook">Cóctel Calavera on Facebook</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 4: Song Festivals -->
			<section class="sax-section alt-bg">
				<div class="inner">
					<div class="sax-grid reverse">
						<div class="sax-text-content">
							<span class="section-tag">04 / Composition & Competitions</span>
							<h2>Song Festivals</h2>
							<p>University song festivals have been a defining creative outlet since day one, offering the opportunity to compete and collaborate alongside exceptional university musicians and composers.</p>
							<p>I have received honorary mentions as one of the festival's top musicians. Furthermore, a track I co-wrote and composed with a university colleague won <strong>Best Lyrics</strong> in the 2018 festival. All saxophone arrangements for my performances were entirely custom-composed.</p>
							<div class="tech-specs">
								<span class="spec-badge">Song Festival Winner</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Best Lyrics Award</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Custom Sax Arrangements</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">University Musician</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="sax-media-wrapper">
							<div class="media-card">
								<div class="video-container">
									<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/334967419" width="100%" height="340" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
								</div>
								<div class="media-caption">Song Festival Performance & Composition Showcase</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 5: Atlixco Chamber Orchestra -->
			<section class="sax-section">
				<div class="inner">
					<div class="sax-grid">
						<div class="sax-media-wrapper">
							<div class="image-card">
								<img src={`${base}images/Orquesta-de-Camara-de-Atlixco.webp`} alt="Atlixco Chamber Orchestra ensemble with founding member Javier Flores" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
								<div class="image-caption">Atlixco Chamber Orchestra — Founding Member & Arranger</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="sax-text-content">
							<span class="section-tag">05 / Orchestral Leadership</span>
							<h2>Atlixco Chamber Orchestra</h2>
							<p>Founded in 2013, the <strong>Atlixco Chamber Orchestra</strong> was established to unite the finest young musicians in Atlixco and form the city's premier chamber orchestra.</p>
							<p>As one of the founding members, my responsibilities extended far beyond performance; I actively managed operations, wrote custom musical arrangements, and served as section leader.</p>
							<div class="tech-specs">
								<span class="spec-badge">Founding Member</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Chamber Orchestra</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Arranger & Manager</span>
								<span class="spec-badge">Section Leader</span>
							</div>
							<div class="actions-wrapper">
								<a href="https://www.facebook.com/Orquesta-de-C%C3%A1mara-de-Atlixco-232123190316860/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button primary-btn icon fa-facebook">OCA on Facebook</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        body, #wrapper {
            background-color: #0f131f !important;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
        }

        .sax-container {
            padding-bottom: 6rem;
        }

        .sax-hero {
            padding: 7rem 0 4rem 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .hero-inner {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #00e5ff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            max-width: 850px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .divider-line {
            height: 3px;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e5ff, #8d82c4);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .sax-section {
            padding: 5rem 0;
        }

        .sax-section.alt-bg {
            background-color: rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.5);
        }

        .sax-grid {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .sax-grid.reverse {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .sax-grid.reverse .sax-text-content {
            order: 1;
        }

        .sax-grid.reverse .sax-media-wrapper {
            order: 2;
        }

        .section-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: #00e5ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .sax-text-content h2 {
            font-size: 2.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .sax-text-content p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .tech-specs {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin: 1.75rem 0;
        }

        .spec-badge {
            background-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            color: #00e5ff;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .media-card, .image-card {
            background: #151b2b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .media-card:hover, .image-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .video-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 340px;
            background: #000;
        }

        .video-container iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
        }

        .image-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .media-caption, .image-caption {
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            background: #111726;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .actions-wrapper {
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .primary-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff, #0088cc) !important;
            color: #0f131f !important;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .primary-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 960px) {
            .sax-grid, .sax-grid.reverse {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2.5rem;
            }
            .sax-grid.reverse .sax-text-content,
            .sax-grid.reverse .sax-media-wrapper {
                order: unset;
            }
            .sax-hero {
                padding: 5rem 0 2rem 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>
